OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTemperatures
OL,6,Fdropping away quickly after dark with
OL,7,Fsome frosty patches forming quickly.
OL,8,FOvernight it turns cloudier with clear
OL,9,Fintervals, but remaining cold for
OL,10,Fmany. Becoming breezier in the far
OL,11,Fsouthwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FSaturday will be a dry day
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells for most with
OL,15,Ftemperatures recovering slightly, but
OL,16,Fstill below average. Overnight, rain
OL,17,Fand stronger winds arrive in Cornwall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
